Chapter: MancalaWasm
  cites Games chapter Mancala
  cites Foreword chapter List

 The browser interface for Mancala, on the handle contract in
 games-backlog.md GAME-11. Fourteen pits holding up to forty-eight seeds
 between them are past an i32 packed, so the page holds the board's address.

 `mancala-move` clears the chosen pit with `list-set-at`, which mutates in
 place, so `mc-wasm-move` copies first.

 This game has a real alpha-beta search, unlike its neighbours: `minimax`
 recurses through `mm-max` and `mm-min` at depth minus one. The search
 applies moves to explore, which is the shape that corrupted Connect Four's
 board (GAME-13), so the grader measures the board across a search rather
 than reasoning about it.

 We say:

Section: Copying

  mc-copy-pits : List Integer, Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  mc-copy-pits (src) (i) (acc) =
    if i >= 14 then acc
    else mc-copy-pits src (i + 1) (list-push acc (list-at src i))

  mc-copy-board : MancalaBoard -> MancalaBoard
  mc-copy-board (b) =
    MancalaBoard {
      pits = mc-copy-pits (b.pits) 0 [],
      turn = b.turn,
      over = b.over
    }

Section: The Browser Interface

  mc-wasm-new : MancalaBoard
  mc-wasm-new = mancala-new 4

  mc-wasm-pit : MancalaBoard, Integer -> Integer
  mc-wasm-pit (b) (i) =
    if i < 0 then (-1)
    else if i >= 14 then (-1)
    else list-at (b.pits) i

  mc-wasm-turn : MancalaBoard -> Integer
  mc-wasm-turn (b) = b.turn

  mc-wasm-done : MancalaBoard -> Integer
  mc-wasm-done (b) = if b.over then 1 else 0

  mc-wasm-legal : MancalaBoard, Integer -> Integer
  mc-wasm-legal (b) (pit) =
    if pit < 0 then 0
    else if pit >= 14 then 0
    else if mancala-legal b pit then 1 else 0

  mc-wasm-move : MancalaBoard, Integer -> MancalaBoard
  mc-wasm-move (b) (pit) =
    if mc-wasm-legal b pit == 0 then b
    else mancala-move (mc-copy-board b) pit

  mc-wasm-ai : MancalaBoard, Integer -> Integer
  mc-wasm-ai (b) (depth) =
    if b.over then (-1)
    else mancala-ai-move b (if depth < 1 then 1 else if depth > 6 then 6 else depth)

  mc-wasm-south-store : MancalaBoard -> Integer
  mc-wasm-south-store (b) = south-store b

  mc-wasm-north-store : MancalaBoard -> Integer
  mc-wasm-north-store (b) = north-store b

